	(text "SPI mode: 1 CS, 2 DI, 5 CLK, 7 DO. DAT1 and DAT2 unused, pulled up.\nCP closes to SW, the common, with a card in: HOLO_CD low.\nWP open with the card's slider on LOCK: HOLO_WP high.\nWith no card WP reads high. Switch pads and polarity:\nfrom memory, TO VERIFY against the Hirose DM1AA data sheet.\nShell to GND. Every card pin meets only U4, U5, D3\nand pull-ups to SD_3V3: never a Pi pin, never +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38a873c3-5733-5293-a906-ee0c2f2af88e")
	)
	(text "SD_3V3 is off until the software sets HOLO_PWR.\nA card pushed in gets no power and sees 0 V\non every pin. D3, not fitted: 4-line ESD array."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 111.76 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "31940d30-5d1e-553d-bbe4-5912d862e6e1")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 170.18 15.24)
		(end 406.4 132.08)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "0f970154-ee67-5839-85fe-294dd0394494")
	)
	(text "Bus buffer U4, U5: the card sees the bus only on HOLO_BUS"
