	(text "HOLO_PWR over about 2 V (R65, R69) and a card in: Q5\npulls R67 low, Q4's gate falls to the Miller plateau and\nC54 sets the slope: 1 ms from 0 to 3.3 V, 50 mA (to verify).\nNo card: HOLO_CD high, Q6 shorts the Q5 base, slot off.\nHOLO_PWR low or floating: R64 and the Pi's pull-down keep\nQ5 off, R66 holds Q4 off, R68 empties SD_3V3 in 50 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 271.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "26b654ec-4f95-5898-ae1e-1562e3f0b0d3")
	)
	(text "U3 stays on: only the switch follows the software.\nU3 max input about 6 V (from memory, to verify)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 271.78 0)
		(effects
